  "tests": "No build/test was run and none is claimed: the tree is unchanged, so there is nothing to build — NOT MEASURED, not green. `git status --porcelain` in the worktree: empty. `node scripts/pm/dispatch-gates.mjs --commands` (exit 2), verbatim: \"dispatch-gates: gate list derived from the tree of 'objectstack-ai/objectstack' at commit dc46c4ec1 (/home/user/objectstack-14897).\" / \"dispatch-gates: this branch changes nothing against 'origin/main' (merge base dc46c4ec1) — nothing to derive.\" check:generated was not run (no generated input changed; running it would measure the base tree, not my work). Measurement commands, all against objectui at pin 00d3f09c500c4a45b5f27aca8af80349412faaf1 in the read-only checkout at /home/user/objectui, none of them edits: `git grep -n \"provider === '\" PIN -- packages/plugin-list/src` returns only 'value' (ListView.tsx:941,1639) and 'api' (:953,:1588) — zero 'object'; `git grep -n \"data.object|provider === 'object'\" PIN -- packages/plugin-list/src` returns EMPTY; `git grep -n 'schema.data' PIN -- packages/plugin-list/src` returns ~15 hits (ListView.tsx:937,939-942,950-953,1585-1588,1631); `git grep -n 'schema.type' PIN -- packages/plugin-list/src` (non-test) returns EMPTY; `git grep -n 'specType' PIN -- packages/plugin-list/src` returns EMPTY; control `git grep -c objectName PIN -- packages/plugin-list/src` hits ListView.tsx:55 and 9 more files, so the channel is live and the empty reads are readings. Manifest cross-check: `node -e` on the tracked root sdui.manifest.json prints list-view inputs = 'objectName, viewType, columns, filter, sort, options' (no data, no type) while ListView.tsx reads schema.data at ~15 sites — a false negative on readers; and object-grid inputs include 'data', which ObjectGrid.tsx:430 does read — so the corpus agrees and disagrees with the implementation for reasons unrelated to reading.",
  "mcp_calls": "7 — issue_read get, issue_read get_comments, search_issues (dedup), search_issues (control), issue_write create (#15367), plus the claim comment and this report comment. REST was 403 for this session ('GitHub access is not enabled for this session') and `gh` is absent, so dedup went through one targeted MCP search_issues plus one control query; channel switch declared per protocol.",
